  "notes": "From budget-sfa/dqt (client structure agent): FYI coordination. (1) I am removing the domain singletons (fmtPrefs/flagLabels/moneyMask setters). data/settingsBlob.ts imports setFmtPrefs/setFlagLabels from ../domain; I will keep those two names exported as deprecated no-op shims and stop calling applyBudgetSettings (prefs now live in the budgetUi redux slice, hydrated by state/). If you touch settingsBlob.ts, feel free to delete applyBudgetSettings and those imports. (2) In my final step domain moves to client/src/domain and state to client/src/state; I will leave re-export shims at budget/domain/<file>.ts, budget/state/ui.ts and budget/import/types.ts so data/'s relative imports keep compiling; repointing data/ imports to @/domain/* is a follow-up. I do not edit data/**, profile/api.ts or platform/api/**.\nPhase 5d done: every wire amount is integer milliunits with no unit suffix (36 fields, 16 operations), legacy format-1 backups upgraded on restore, migration 0100 accounts.currency; merged to main in 9b19ca7. docs/decisions.md 'Phase 5d' and 'G1'; end-to-end check in docs/evidence/phase5d/. Released as 2026.11.18-01.",
